;http://Club-SyNdicate.atspace.org;
;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;;

;------------------Variables used-----------------------------------
; Var(1)  = chain combos
;      0  = reset var
;      1  = active var
; Var(2)  = Change styles of fighting
;      0  = Freehand
;      1  = Swordplay
; Var(3)  = Freehand mode crouching hard punch
;      0  = MK style uppercut
;      1  = Vs. series style uppercut (otg combo launcher)
; Var(4)  = Panther commands
;      0  = able to give commands
;      1  = temporarily prevents commands to be given
; Var(5)  = Self Destruct Varibles.
;      0  = Engage self destruct mode
;      1  = prevents changestate from above variable
;      2  = same as above
; Var(6)  = PROVE YOURSELF logo with dramatic pause
;      0  = resets variable after 100 ticks
;      1  = activates after final blow was delivered for 100 ticks
; Var(7)  = Prevents helper(Panther) from appearing at certain moments
;      1  = stays destroyed after detonation when player is in win states.
;      0  = not used
; Var(8)  = detects how many hits the panther recives after its self destruct mode is activated
;     1-4 = does nothing but takes away the panthers life making it very unstable
;      5  = explodes and destroys self after five hits
; Var(10) = keeps track of the amount of time while the OuroborosV2 is at use
;      0  =  resets the variable after its usage time is up and when the orbs leaves the screen
;      1  =  activates when the command is implemented and disables the command once activated
; Var(12) = Pause menu, (Stats screen/Moveslist)
;      0  = resets varible, returns to game
;      1  = Views player and helpers statistics and moves
; Var(58) = used to keep keep count of wins during a match.
;      0  = resets variable
;      1  = actives after a Hiryu wins a round
; Var(59) = used for death move conditions
;      0  = resets variable
;      1  = activates when Hiryu has won a round and the opponent has less than 3 points of life
;-------------------------------------------------------------------
; Swordplay basics 
;-------------------------------------------------------------------
;standing
;-------------------
